WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
The worker had nothing to carry.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.100
It wrote a placeholder for weeks.

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.200
But a prompt is not a website.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.200
Finding one needs a search we do not have.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.100
So it refuses to guess one.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.700
Cited, quoted, and the wrong company.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.500
Then: write the report after every page.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.300
Partial and finished are the same shape.

9
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.500
And stream it without a broker.

10
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.900
Two processes already share a row.

11
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.700
A section is sent once it has something.

12
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.200
Empty means we finished. It has not.

13
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.700
And a late write is quietly ignored.

14
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.000
Somebody is reading that report.

15
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.300
One company, through the product.

16
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.300
The spinner has content behind it now.
